<title>FRANCE: CYCLING-CIPOLLINI WINS TOUR DE FRANCE SECOND STAGE.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-CIPOLLINI WINS TOUR DE FRANCE SECOND STAGE.</headline>
<dateline>VIRE, France 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's Mario Cipollini won the 262 km second stage of the Tour de France from St Valery-en-Caux to Vire on Monday.</p>
<p>He retained the race leader's yellow jersey.</p>
</text>
